>term nestedModuleNameError = (λe.strings.concat ["module namespace ", packaging.ModuleName[] (error.packaging.NestedModuleNameError[outer] e), " is a strict dotted-prefix of module namespace ", packaging.ModuleName[] (error.packaging.NestedModuleNameError[inner] e)])@{description="Show a nested module name error as a string"}
